          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Artistic Vision and Challenges</strong><br>\nCoppola's films are known for their ambitious artistic vision and depth. However, he often faced challenges such as production difficulties, financial issues, and critical receptions that varied from praise to skepticism.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Expansion into Other Ventures</strong><br>\nBeyond directing, Coppola is also a successful producer and screenwriter, and he has ventured into other industries, including publishing and winemaking. His diverse interests reflect a broader creative spirit that extends beyond cinema.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Influence on Modern Cinema</strong><br>\nCoppola has influenced modern cinema through his distinctive storytelling and is often cited for his innovative use of sound and visual style. His work has inspired a generation of filmmakers and continues to be studied and admired.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
