            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Collaboration and Family</strong><br>\nCoppola often collaborates with family members, including his daughter Sofia Coppola, and actors like Al Pacino and Robert De Niro, creating a collaborative environment that nurtures strong performances and filmmaking partnerships.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ongoing Work and Adaptability</strong><br>\nEven after decades in the industry, Coppola continues to work on various projects, adapting to new technologies and changing audience tastes while remaining committed to his unique vision and approach to storytelling.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Recognition and Legacy</strong><br>\nCoppola's legacy includes multiple Academy Awards and a reputation for creating some of the most memorable films in American cinema. His ongoing contributions and innovative work in film continue to earn him recognition as a leading figure in the industry.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
